WEBVTT

00:14:25.689 --> 00:14:30.839
So let the small act of planting flowers

00:14:30.839 --> 00:14:34.166
and keeping them free of pesticides

00:14:34.166 --> 00:14:38.381
be the driver of large-scale change.

00:14:38.381 --> 00:14:41.417
On behalf of the bees, thank you.

00:14:41.417 --> 00:14:45.540
(Applause)

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:49.508
Chris Anderson: Thank you. Just a quick question.

00:14:49.508 --> 00:14:52.664
The latest numbers on the die-off of bees,

00:14:52.664 --> 00:14:54.892
is there any sign of things bottoming out?

00:14:54.892 --> 00:14:57.671
What's your hope/depression level on this?

00:14:57.671 --> 00:14:58.285
Maria Spivak: Yeah.

00:14:58.285 --> 00:15:00.238
At least in the United States,